WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Add the case files.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Lylo reads them and finds the key facts.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.000
It pulls in pay, dates, pension, and other loss details.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.500
It uses these numbers to work out the claimant's loss.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Lylo then builds a clear Schedule of Loss for you to check.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.500
You can edit the draft yourself, like a normal document.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:37.500
Or open AI Changes and ask Lylo to make a change.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:43.500
Lylo updates the draft and works out the new figures.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:48.500
You check the result before it is used.
